<!--
  English abbreviation lexicon for icukit.

  Provenance: this inventory was drafted programmatically as a first useful
  pass and is PENDING HUMAN REVIEW (see @status="draft"). Entries favor
  well-known, defensible abbreviations; ambiguity is recorded honestly rather
  than resolved. Expansions are given where a real written long form exists;
  surfaces with no clean expansion (e.g. "Ms.") carry none and simply suppress
  the sentence break.

  Validated against abbreviations.rng.
-->
